# Delivery layer (`app/` + delivery helpers)

## Thin delivery

- Parse/validate with **Zod** at the boundary (`safeParse` + structured errors).
- Compose deps via `getApplicationDeps()` — **no ad-hoc Prisma** in routes/actions.
- Call **one** application use case per action when possible; map result to UI/JSON/redirect.
- Side effects tied to HTTP lifecycle (`after()`, `revalidatePath`) stay in delivery — not in `src/core/application/`.

## File placement

| Kind | Location |
|------|----------|
| Routes, layouts, server actions | `app/` |
| Colocated delivery helpers (`schedule-analysis-jobs.ts`, action-only utils) | `app/[feature]/` next to actions |
| Shared server helpers (cookies, auth context) | `lib/*-server-context.ts`, `lib/*-access.ts` |
| Pure utilities | `lib/` (no `next/*`, no React) |

## Imports

- May import: `src/core/application`, port types, `lib/application-deps`, Zod schemas.
- Must not import: deep adapter internals (except composition/tests).

## IDOR

Follow [`idor-authorization.mdc`](idor-authorization.mdc) on every org-owned resource.
